    {
      "id": "sol.ahsme-1963-p3.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The equation is \\(\\frac1{x+1}=x-1.\\) Hence \\(1=x^2-1,\\) so \\(x=\\pm\\sqrt2.\\) Neither value is listed.\n\nThus, the correct answer is E.",
      "hints": [
        "Translate “the reciprocal of \\(x+1\\)” into an equation",
        "Multiplying by \\(x+1\\) leads to a difference of squares"
      ],
